    "diagnosis": "<p>Angiolipoma</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Core biopsy shows a distinct lesional edge from adjacent fat. The lesion is composed of congeries of congested capillaries among adipocytic lobules. Several fibrin thrombi are seen within the capillaries. No breast lobules are seen. Many angiolipomas are found in the subcutaneous tissue overlying the breast.</p>",
